{
"file": 53,
"paths": [
"d007/d000/f127"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "15fa5f01",
"en_raw": "Even Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "6a41711b",
"en_raw": "is taking Sakai's side..."
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "eb2c2bd4",
"en_raw": "Why, all of a sudden?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "4846c4de",
"en_raw": "Because you're always talking"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "88e1f0fe",
"en_raw": "in the bathroom"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "65b44e9d",
"en_raw": "It's about badmouthing me, right?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "9316276c",
"en_raw": "...That's a misunderstanding"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "5bd011eb",
"en_raw": "Hey, class rep, what's wrong?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "e6f30e85",
"en_raw": "You're acting a bit odd"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "c7ac5bfe",
"en_raw": "It's nothing like that"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "29e0ddd1",
"en_raw": "More importantly, what were you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "5818474c",
"en_raw": "I just heard that the old man"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "81c0d6c1",
"en_raw": "who walks around died"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "9eb0e750",
"en_raw": "Honestly, nothing but nasty lies"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "64eee7a5",
"en_raw": "That old man is alive"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "c5916282",
"en_raw": "You'd even make people dead"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "8f6026fe",
"en_raw": "...The worst"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "79d42c06",
"en_raw": "Wait a second"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "5335a6e9",
"en_raw": "That's an unfair accusation"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "311125c6",
"en_raw": "The Toilet Gang does seem"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "ff93960d",
"en_raw": "like liars, but if you deny everything..."
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "86a2c7fc",
"en_raw": "It's about people's lives"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "43e7547a",
"en_raw": "If it were a nasty rumor"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "6b1b13e9",
"en_raw": "what would you do, Hirauchi?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "2edf84e1",
"en_raw": "Why am I being blamed?"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "e746693d",
"en_raw": "If you believe what Sakai and them say"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "470baf41",
"en_raw": "you're no different"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "a8de93f4",
"en_raw": "Fine, then... let's bet"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "c07ec5a0",
"en_raw": "If that old man is alive"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "4e5dd8bf",
"en_raw": "the class rep wins"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "d39699c4",
"en_raw": "Such a bet..."
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "98e8a1fe",
"en_raw": "What, no confidence?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "f48bf21f",
"en_raw": "The Toilet Gang was full of it"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "4079d30f",
"en_raw": "...Fine, understood"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "85974cac",
"en_raw": "If I win"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "c100b6d1",
"en_raw": "you have to go to choir practice"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "d24137c4",
"en_raw": "with Sakai and them, no excuses"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "e9b3a778",
"en_raw": "If I win, what happens?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "cd743894",
"en_raw": "You don't want me to... interfere, right?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "98407b5f",
"en_raw": "Good, the bet is on"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "32cb2d9f",
"en_raw": "Then I'll go confirm the truth"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "c7c3893f",
"en_raw": "Obtained the rumor of the Walking Old Man!"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "dc27a095",
"en_raw": "Fine, whatever"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "cb07f909",
"en_raw": "I know already..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "7a588f32",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "4a1c5166",
"en_raw": "Don't forget the bet"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "bfca88ec",
"en_raw": "Understood~"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "1df58ad3",
"en_raw": "See you."
}
]
}